" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Khorloogiin Choibalsan</span><span class="tp">1895–1952</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/demchugdongrub"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/demchugdongrub.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Demchugdongrub</span><span class="tp">1902–1966</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/tunku-abdul-rahman"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/tunku-abdul-rahman.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Tunku Abdul Rahman</span><span class="tp">1903–1990</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/mauricio-macri"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/mauricio-macri.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Mauricio Macri</span><span class="tp">b. 1959</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 8 February <span class="n">3</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/przemysl-ii"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/przemysl-ii.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Przemysł II</span><span class="tp">1257–1296</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/france-preseren"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/france-preseren.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">France Prešeren</span><span class="tp">1800–1849</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/sam-nujoma"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/sam-nujoma.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Sam Nujoma</span><span class="tp">1929–2025</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
